Revision history for Dist-Zilla-App-Command-podchecker

0.001 2026-11-06 TEODESIAN
    - Initial release.  dzil podchecker runs the plugins of a distribution
      in memory, and checks the POD of each file as the build weaves it.
      The idea and the order of the plugin phases come from
      Dist::Zilla::App::Command::podpreview, by Peter Shangov.
